  "extraction_notes": [
    "The datasheet covers the TO-220 IRF100B201 and package sibling IRF100S201; the electrical characteristics and typical curves are shared.",
    "No separate capacitance-at-zero-VDS table value is published; Fig. 7 was digitized for voltage dependence.",
    "Gate resistance is 2.2 ohm typical (p. 2); Qg = 170 nC typical, Qgs = 46 nC typical, Qgd = 45 nC typical at the stated gate-charge conditions (p. 3).",
    "Body-diode reverse recovery is trr = 47 ns typical at TJ = 25 degC and 55 ns at TJ = 125 degC, with Qrr = 90 nC and 123 nC respectively (p. 3).",
    "IDSS is 20 uA maximum at VDS = 100 V, VGS = 0 V and 250 uA maximum at VDS = 80 V, VGS = 0 V, TJ = 125 degC (p. 2).",
    "Thermal resistances are RthetaJC = 0.34 degC/W maximum and RthetaJA = 62 degC/W maximum (p. 2)."
